    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O'Connell Properties are delighted to bring to the market 7 Summerseat Court located in Clonee, Dublin 15. A splendid 2 bedroom apartment located in the much sought after location of Clonee. The accommodation extends to c. 63 sq. meters and comprises of a spacious, open plan living/dining room and kitchen. This property has 2 double bedrooms with built in wardrobes, an En Suite, and a family bathroom. The property has been lovingly maintained by its present owner and is presented in excellent condition throughout.\r\n\r\nThis is a much sought after development with an abundance of open space and many local amenities, recreational facilities and an excellent choice of national and secondary schools. The M50 Motorway is only 2 kms away and Dublin City Centre c.10kms. The Blanchardstown Shopping Center and Connolly Hospital are within close proximity and Dublin Airport is only a 10 minute drive.\r\n\r\nWhilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intended purchasers/lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information given."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\nLiving Room: 5.2m x 4.7m : with wood flooring, sliding doors to the terrace area, and feature gas fireplace\r\n\r\nKitchen: 3.2m x 2m: With a tiled floor and splash backs, and modern shaker style kitchen\r\n\r\nBedroom 4.2m X 2.7m : Double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and wood flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 4.2m x 2.1m: Double bedroom with a built-in wardrobe and wood flooring.\r\n\r\nEn Suite: 2m X 1.8m with electric shower, WHB, and WC\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2m X 1.8m: with a bath, WHB, and WC"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A beautifully presented apartment in excellent condition throughout\r\nLocated in a much sought after quite, mature location\r\nBER B\r\nMature residential area and great location close to shops, schools and transport links\r\nExcellent local national and secondary schools\r\nOnly 3km from Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and c.12km from Dublin City Centre\r\nVibrant community with many sporting and social clubs and facilities in the area"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      }
